  "releaseNotes": "1.0.3: fixed: a promo banner in a banner slot AdMob could not fill (BeeAppie.Maui.MTAdmob) collapsed into the middle of the slot after the device was rotated, on Android. A PromoBannerView now builds for its new width when its space changes, so it stays laid out after a rotation or a resize, in an ad slot or anywhere else. See https://beeappie.com/changelog for what changes in each version.",
